cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software release and the associated article when available."
title: "Claims and evidence for reused data-derived patient labels: a specification, a survey of sepsis partitions, and a worked example: analysis code"
type: software
abstract: "Code-only claim-specific EHR label audit with post hoc temperature correction, verified Raw-model reconstruction using the archived L2 recipe, corrected external evaluation and paired comparisons, held-out recalibration and hospital funnel. Restricted data, fitted objects and empirical figure sources are excluded."
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-15
